捕捉其他動物來吃的動物。","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"偽裝","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裝成別的樣子，讓別人不容易發現。","n":16,"ssz":".....1.........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一模一樣","n":4,"ssz":"2.1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"完全相同，看不出差別。","n":11,"ssz":"..1.....1.."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"枯萎","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"枯：乾枯；萎：下垂；指植物失去水分，變乾、變黃、下垂。","n":27,"ssz":"................1.........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"威嚇","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用可怕的樣子或動作讓對方害怕。","n":15,"ssz":".....1........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"活靈活現","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"模仿、描寫或表演得很生動，像真的一樣。","n":19,"ssz":"........1.......1.."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"銅牆鐵壁","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"像銅和鐵做的牆一樣堅固；比喻非常堅固，很難攻破。","n":24,"ssz":"..1....1................"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讚嘆","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"覺得很厲害或很美好，而佩服、稱讚。","n":17,"ssz":".1..............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"弱肉強食","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在自然界中，弱小的動物容易被強大的動物吃掉；也可形容競爭很殘酷。","n":32,"ssz":"................................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"盆栽好幾天沒有澆水，葉子慢慢變黃，開始（　）。","n":23,"ssz":"...........1..........."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這對雙胞胎不只長得像，連說話的聲音都幾乎（　）。","n":24,"ssz":".......11.........1....."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他把老師說話的語氣模仿得（　），全班都笑了。","n":22,"ssz":"...........1.........."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"詐騙集團把假訊息（　）成銀行簡訊，騙人點連結填資料。","n":26,"ssz":".............1............"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"決賽最後一分鐘，球隊防守得像（　），讓對手完全攻不進來。","n":28,"ssz":"....2.......1...........1..."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"陌生人靠近時，小狗露出牙齒低吼，像是在（　）對方。","n":25,"ssz":".........1..............."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"科展上，同學用回收材料做出自動澆水器，讓評審都忍不住（　）。","n":30,"ssz":"........................1....."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小青蛙趴在綠葉上，遠遠看去幾乎和葉子（　），不仔細看，根本找不到牠。","n":34,"ssz":".............1.1.1............1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列句子中，「　」內的語詞使用何者錯誤？","n":20,"ssz":"...1................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"竹節蟲停在枝葉間，身體顏色和四周景物「融為一體」","n":24,"ssz":".............1.......2.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"詐騙集團把假簡訊「偽裝」成銀行通知，引誘民眾點開連結","n":26,"ssz":"..............1..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他模仿老師說話的神情和語氣，表演得「活靈活現」","n":23,"ssz":"..........1.....1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這座城堡裝飾華麗，像「銅牆鐵壁」般美麗","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比較本文第2、3段，「保護色」和「偽裝」最主要的差別是什麼？","n":30,"ssz":"...............1.............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1]